<h1>Reset your Wheelhouse password</h1>

<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password of the Wheelhouse account
  <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>.
</p>

<p>
  Choose a new one on
  <%= link_to "this password reset page", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>.
  The link works once, and expires in
  <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
</p>

<p>If it wasn't you, ignore this email: your password stays as it is.</p>

<p>— Wheelhouse</p>
